  ('about-koinonia-faq/index.html', '51', '2.       Register: After your application is approved, you can fill out our [New Family Registration](../newfamilyregistration/). Once we have your registration, you will be contacted by the leadership team to discuss where you would best fit as a teacher or helper.', 51, 'p')
