  ('about-koinonia-faq/index.html', '55', 'This was our first semester at Koinonia but we were immediately at home with this great group of families. Our boys have good friends among the other kids and are getting to know even more kids in other families. I enjoyed the fellowship with the other moms in a relaxed environment of spiritual unity.', 55, 'p')
